  "details": "Version:Build 1123\nI have encountered a new problem,where my fps is significantly decreased with certain avatars,notably those that use any kind of physics/dynamic bones.There were no previous issue like this with said avatars.\nAvatars with no physics don't have an effect on fps.\nI tried lowering the graphics in the safety-performance menu,increasing priority in task manager,I tried limiting or completely disabling dynamic bones,and even reinstalling the game,but none of them solved my problem.\nSteps to reproduce:Using any avatar with dynamic bones",
